    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Can I Get Admission into UI with a 180 JAMB Score?</h1>
      <p>University of Ibadan &middot; Cut-off Mark Analysis for <%= session %></p>
    </section>

    <div class="container">
      <%- include('../includeFolder/_admission_queryLink.ejs') %>

      <div class="section-txt">
        <h2>University of Ibadan Cut-off Benchmark</h2>
        <p>The University of Ibadan (UI) remains one of Nigeria's premier academic institutions with high candidate demand and competitive admission benchmarks. For consecutive academic sessions, UI maintains a general institutional cut-off mark of <strong>200 and above</strong>.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="section-txt">
        <h2>Evaluating Your Chances with a Score of 180</h2>
        <ul class="child-ul">
          <li><strong>Below Benchmark Cut-off:</strong> Because UI sets its baseline threshold at 200, a JAMB score of 180 fails to meet the basic Post-UTME application benchmark.</li>
          <li><strong>High Competition Thresholds:</strong> Premier programs including Medicine, Law, Pharmacy, and Engineering generally demand scores exceeding 250 to stay competitive.</li>
          <li><strong>Post-UTME Eligibility:</strong> Candidates below 200 are typically ineligible to register for UI Post-UTME screening exercises.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="section-txt">
        <h2>Recommended Strategic Options</h2>
        <ul class="child-ul">
          <li><strong>Process a Change of Institution:</strong> Switch your preferred choice on the JAMB portal to state universities, polytechnics, or federal institutions accepting baseline cut-off marks of 160–180.</li>
          <li><strong>Enroll in Pre-Degree or JUPEB Programs:</strong> Alternative pathways like JUPEB allow candidate entry directly into the 200 level upon program completion.</li>
          <li><strong>Prepare to Retake JAMB:</strong> If studying at UI is your primary target, consider reapplying for the upcoming UTME cycle to achieve a competitive score of 200+.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="section-txt">
        <h2>Useful Links</h2>
